+The opt-in `unixnu-deferred-submit` Cargo feature hands ready submissions to the scheduler
+worker. Submission handlers run on that worker, and a slow handler or check can delay later
+submissions. Commit preparation and synchronization can still block. The default remains inline
+submission when the scheduler is free.
